<li><a href="updateMoMaMe_TOUCH_TRAINING.html" class="code" title="function updateMoMaMe_TOUCH_TRAINING(option)">updateMoMaMe_TOUCH_TRAINING</a>	updateMoMaMe_TOUCH_TRAINING(option)</li></ul>
